ule will focus on developing problem-solving skills in design, including identifying problems, brainstorming solutions, and testing prototypes.","sub_modules":[{"id":"M2-S1","title":"Identifying Problems","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn how to identify problems in design and create personas and user journeys.","activities":[{"id":"M2-S1-A1","title":"Persona Exercise","description":"Students will create a persona for a fictional character based on real-world data."},{"id":"M2-S1-A2","title":"User Journey Exercise","description":"Students will create a user journey map for a simple task."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand how to identify problems in design and create personas and user journeys."]},{"id":"M2-S2","title":"Brainstorming Solutions","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about brainstorming techniques for generating innovative solutions to design problems.","activities":[{"id":"M2-S2-A1","title":"Mind Mapping Exercise","description":"Students will create a mind map to generate ideas for a simple problem."},{"id":"M2-S2-A2","title":"Brainstorming Session","description":"Students will participate in a group brainstorming session to generate solutions to a design problem."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand how to use brainstorming techniques to generate innovative solutions to design problems."]},{"id":"M2-S3","title":"Testing Prototypes","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about testing prototypes and gathering feedback from users.","activities":[{"id":"M2-S3-A1","title":"Usability Test Exercise","description":"Students will conduct a usability test on a simple prototype to gather feedback."},{"id":"M2-S3-A2","title":"A/B Testing Exercise","description":"Students will design and execute an A/B testing experiment to compare the performance of two prototypes."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand how to test prototypes and gather feedback from users."]}]},{"id":"M3","title":"Logical Reasoning in Design"