fective solutions."]}]},{"id":"M4","title":"Effective Design Communication","description":"This module will focus on developing skills for communicating design effectively, including presenting ideas and working with teams.","sub_modules":[{"id":"M4-S1","title":"Presenting Ideas","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about techniques for presenting design ideas effectively to stakeholders and team members.","activities":[{"id":"M4-S1-A1","title":"Presentation Exercise","description":"Students will create a presentation to present their design idea."},{"id":"M4-S1-A2","title":"Feedback Session","description":"Students will participate in a feedback session to receive constructive criticism on their presentation."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand techniques for presenting design ideas effectively."]},{"id":"M4-S2","title":"Working with Teams","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about collaboration strategies and conflict resolution techniques for working effectively in teams.","activities":[{"id":"M4-S2-A1","title":"Team Collaboration Exercise","description":"Students will participate in a team collaboration exercise to work on a design project."},{"id":"M4-S2-A2","title":"Conflict Resolution Exercise","description":"Students will participate in a conflict resolution exercise to resolve disagreements with team members."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand collaboration strategies and conflict resolution techniques for working effectively in teams."]},{"id":"M4-S3","title":"Design Communication Tools","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about design communication tools and software to facilitate effective design communication.","activities":[{"id":"M4-S3-A1","title":"Design Tool Exercise","description":"Students will create a presentation using a design tool to communicate their design idea."},{"id":"M4-S3-A2","title":"Design Software Review","description":"Students will review and discuss different design software options for effective design communication."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand design communication tools and software to facilitate effective design communication."]}]},{"id":"M5","title":"Final Project","description":"In this module, students will apply their knowledge and skills from previous modules to work on a final project that demonstrates their ability to solve real-world design problems.","sub_modules":[{"id":"M5-S1","title":"Project Planning","description":"Students will create a project plan and timeline for their final project.","activities":[{"id":"M5-S1-A1","title":"Project Plan Exercise","description":"Students will create a project plan and timeline for their final project."},{"id":"M5-S1-A2","title":"Project Management Tools Review","description":"Students will review and discuss different project management tools to use for effective project planning."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand how to create a project plan and timeline for a design project."]},{"id":"M5-S2","title":"Research and Analysis","description":"Students will conduct research and analysis to identify problems and opportunities in their final project.","activities":[{"id":"M5-S2-A1","title":"Research Exercise","description":"Students will conduct research to identify problems and opportunities in their final project."},{"id":"M5-S2-A2","title":"Analysis Exercise","description":"Students will analyze data from their research to inform their design decisions."}],"learning_outcomes":["Understand how to conduct research and analysis to identify problems and opportunities in a design project."]},{"id":"M5-S3","title":"Design Solution","description":"Students will develop and refine their design solution based on their research and analysis.","activities":[{"id":"M5-S3-A1","title":"Design Exercise","description":"Students will develop and refine their design solution for their final project."},{"id":"M5-S3-A2","title":"Prototype Review","description":"Students will review and provide 