r systems."]},{"id":"M1-S4","title":"Machine Learning Algorithms","description":"This sub-module covers various machine learning algorithms, including supervised and unsupervised learning.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Machine Learning Algorithms","duration":"5 hours","id":"M1-S4-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Machine Learning Algorithms","duration":"1 hour","score":90.0,"id":"M1-S4-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Describe the different types of machine learning algorithms.","Explain how to implement supervised and unsupervised learning."]},{"id":"M1-S5","title":"Model Evaluation and Selection","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about model evaluation metrics and techniques for selecting the best model.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Model Evaluation and Selection","duration":"3 hours","id":"M1-S5-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Model Evaluation and Selection","duration":"30 minutes","score":85.0,"id":"M1-S5-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain model evaluation metrics.","Describe techniques for selecting the best model."]},{"id":"M1-S6","title":"Deployment and Maintenance of Machine Learning Models","description":"This sub-module covers how to deploy and maintain machine learning models in production.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Deployment and Maintenance of Machine Learning Models","duration":"4 hours","id":"M1-S6-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Deployment and Maintenance of Machine Learning Models","duration":"45 minutes","score":80.0,"id":"M1-S6-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Describe how to deploy machine learning models in production.","Explain techniques for maintaining machine learning models."]}],"duration":"20 hours"},{"id":"M2","title":"Advanced Topics","description":"In this module, students will learn about advanced topics in machine learning, including deep learning and transfer learning.","sub_modules":[{"id":"M2-S1","title":"Deep Learning","description":"This sub-module covers the basics of deep learning, including neural networks and convolutional neural networks.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Introduction to Deep Learning","duration":"5 hours","id":"M2-S1-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Deep Learning Basics","duration":"1 hour","score":85.0,"id":"M2-S1-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain the basics of deep learning.","Describe how to implement convolutional neural networks."]},{"id":"M2-S2","title":"Transfer Learning","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about transfer learning and its applications in machine learning.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Introduction to Transfer Learning","duration":"3 hours","id":"M2-S2-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Transfer Learning Applications","duration":"30 minutes","score":80.0,"id":"M2-S2-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain the concept of transfer learning.","Describe how to apply transfer learning in machine learning."]},{"id":"M2-S3","title":"Reinforcement Learning","description":"This sub-module covers the basics of reinforcement learning, including Q-learning and policy gradients.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Introduction to Reinforcement Learning","duration":"4 hours","id":"M2-S3-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Reinforcement Learning Basics","duration":"45 minutes","score":90.0,"id":"M2-S3-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain the basics of reinforcement learning.","Describe how to implement Q-learning and policy gradients."]},{"id":"M2-S4","title":"Unsupervised Learning","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about unsupervised learning, including clustering and dimensionality reduction.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Introduction to Unsupervised Learning","duration":"4 hours","id":"M2-S4-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Unsupervised Learning Basics","duration":"45 minutes","score":85.0,"id":"M2-S4-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain the basics of unsupervised learning.","Describe how to implement clustering and dimensionality reduction."]},{"id":"M2-S5","title":"Model Interpretability","description":"This sub-module covers techniques for interpreting machine learning models, including feature importance and partial dependence plots.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Introduction to Model Interpretability","duration":"3 hours","id":"M2-S5-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Model Interpretability Techniques","duration":"30 minutes","score":80.0,"id":"M2-S5-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain model interpretability techniques.","Describe how to implement feature importance and partial dependence plots."]},{"id":"M2-S6","title":"Bias-Variance Tradeoff","description":"In this sub-module, students will learn about the bias-variance tradeoff and its implications for machine learning models.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Introduction to Bias-Variance Tradeoff","duration":"2 hours","id":"M2-S6-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Bias-Variance Tradeoff Implications","duration":"15 minutes","score":75.0,"id":"M2-S6-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain the bias-variance tradeoff.","Describe its implications for machine learning models."]},{"id":"M2-S7","title":"Overfitting and Underfitting","description":"This sub-module covers techniques for avoiding overfitting and underfitting, including regularization and cross-validation.","activities":[{"type":"Video Lecture","title":"Introduction to Overfitting and Underfitting","duration":"2 hours","id":"M2-S7-A1"},{"type":"Interactive Quiz","title":"Overfitting and Underfitting Techniques","duration":"15 minutes","score":75.0,"id":"M2-S7-A2"}],"learning_outcomes":["Explain techniques for avoiding overfitting.","Describe techniques for avoiding underfitting."]}],"duration":"10 hours"}]},"course_id":53,"user_id":1,"quiz_performance":{"topic_scores":{"general":100.0,"problem_solving":0.0,"learning_style":50.0,"logical_reasoning