d":"M2","title":"General Knowledge","description":"This module provides a comprehensive overview of the Facebook Blueprint certification program's core topics.","sub_modules":[{"id":"M2-S1","title":"Facebook Advertising Fundamentals","description":"This sub-module covers the basics of Facebook advertising, including targeting options, ad formats, and budgeting.","activities":[{"id":"M2-S1-A1","title":"Complete a course on Facebook Ad Format Options.","description":"Learn about different ad format options available for advertisers."},{"id":"M2-S1-A2","title":"Create and optimize ad campaigns using the Facebook Ads Manager tool.","description":"Practice creating and optimizing ad campaigns to improve your skills in targeting, budgeting, and ad placement."}],"learning_outcomes":["Apply knowledge of ad format options for optimal advertising outcomes.","Demonstrate an understanding of how to target audiences effectively using Facebook's advanced targeting features."]},{"id":"M2-S2","title":"Content Marketing and Branding","description":"This sub-module focuses on the importance of content marketing, branding, and social media for businesses.","activities":[{"id":"M2-S2-A1","title":"Complete a course on Content Marketing Fundamentals for Brands.","description":"Learn how to create engaging content that attracts and retains customers."},{"id":"M2-S2-A2","title":"Develop a brand voice and style guide for your business.","description":"Create a comprehensive brand voice and style guide that outlines the tone, language, and visual identity of your business."}],"learning_outcomes":["Describe how to create engaging content using Facebook Blueprint's content marketing guidelines.","Apply knowledge of branding principles for businesses looking to establish or maintain their online presence."]}],"duration":"8 weeks, 40 hours"},{"id":"M3","title":"Problem Solving and Logical Reasoning","description":"This module focuses on developing critical thinking skills for problem-solving in the context of Facebook Blueprint certification.","sub_modules":[{"id":"M3-S1","title":"Critical Thinking and Analytical Skills","description":"This sub-module introduces learners to critical thinking techniques, including identifying biases and logical fallacies.","activities":[{"id":"M3-S1-A1","title":"Practice analyzing arguments for biases and logical fallacies.","description":"Complete exercises to improve your ability to identify flawed reasoning and evaluate evidence critically."},{"id":"M3-S1-A2","title":"Learn how to effectively present a well-supported argument using data and evidence.","description":"Practice structuring arguments with clear premises, supporting evidence, and sound logical connections."}],"learning_outcomes":["Demonstrate an understanding of critical thinking techniques for problem-solving in Facebook Blueprint certification.","Apply knowledge of logical reasoning principles to present well-supported arguments using data and evidence."]},{"id":"M3-S2","title":"Logical Reasoning and Mathematical Applications","description":"This module provides a comprehensive overview of logical reasoning and mathematical concepts for Facebook Blueprint certification.","activities":[{"id":"M3-S2-A1","title":"Practice applying mathematical formulas to solve advertising optimization problems.","description":"Complete exercises on calculating cost per click, conversion rates, and return on ad spend using mathematical formulas from the Facebook Blueprint certification course."},{"id":"M3-S2-A2","title":"Learn how to apply logical reasoning principles in Facebook Ads Manager to optimize campaigns for better performance.","description":"Practice optimizing campaigns by applying logical reasoning principles and evaluating evidence of different campaign settings."}],"learning_outcomes":["Apply knowledge of mathematical formulas to solve advertising optimization problems using data from the Facebook Blueprint certification course.","Demonstrate an understanding of logical reasoning principles for optimizing Facebook Ads Manager campaigns for better performance."]},{"id":"M3-S3","title":"Motivation and Learning Style","description":"This module focuses on learner motivation, self-assessment, and learning styles to enhance the overall effectiveness of Facebook Blueprint certification.","activities":[{"id":"M3-S3-A1","title":"Reflect on your learning style preferences and identify areas for improvement.","description":"Complete a learning style quiz to determine your strengths and weaknesses, and provide self-assessment suggestions to optimize learning outcomes."},{"id":"M3-S3-A2","title":"Develop a plan to stay motivated throughout the Facebook Blueprint certification program.","description":"Create a personalized study plan and set realistic goals for achieving the desired knowledge level in each module within the given timeframe."}],"learning_outcomes":["Reflect on their learning style preferences and identify areas for improvement.","Develop a plan to stay motivated throughout the Facebook Blueprint certification program based on their strengths, weaknesses, and motivation triggers."]},{"id":"M3-S4","title":"Final Project: Creating a Comprehensive Facebook Ad Campaign","description":"This module guides learners in applying all skills learned throughout the certification program to create a comprehensive ad campaign.","activities":[{"id":"M3-S4-A1","title":"Design and develop a comprehensive Facebook ad campaign that showcases your knowledge of core topics.","description":"Create a well-designed and optimized ad campaign for a fictional company using the skills learned throughout the certification program, including content creation, targeting, budgeting, bidding, and tracking."},{"id":"M3-S4-A2","title":"Present your final project to peers or an instructor for feedback and discussion.","description":"Share a brief presentation with an audience about the challenges encountered during campaign development and discuss any insights gained from the experience."}],"learning_outcomes":["Create a comprehensive Facebook ad campaign that showcases knowledge of core topics learned throughout the certification program.","Present their final project to peers or instructor for feedback and discussion, providing insight into challenges encountered during campaign development."]}],"duration":"16 weeks, 80 hours"}],"prerequisites":["Basic understanding of marketing principles","Prior knowledge in advertising and media planning is not required but will be beneficial to a better comprehension of the course content."],"quiz_adaptations":["Use adaptive technology, such as AI-powered quizzes, to assess learners' progress and understanding of key concepts.","Provide multiple-choice questions that align with each module's learning objectives","Ensure quizzes are relevant and meaningful to each module's content and apply relevant assessment criteria."]},"course_id":60,"user_id":1,"quiz_performance":{"topic_scores":{"general":100.0,"problem_solving":0.0,"learning_style":50.0,"logical_reasoning":100.0,"mathematical":100.0,"motivation":100.0},"overall_score":70.0,"weak_areas":["problem_solving","learning_style"],"strengths":["general","logical_reasoning","mathematical","motivation"],"total_questions_answered":10,"question_distribution":{"general":1,"problem_solving":2,"learning_style":2,"logical_reasoning":2,"mathematical":2,"motivation":1}}}
